msgid "Non-GPS Navigation"
msgstr "非 GPS 导航"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page.rst:12
#: 90c0d711113f48af8011e6b51df500fa
msgid ""
"These are the available options that allow a vehicle to estimate its "
"position without a GPS.  Once enabled this allows all autonomous and semi-"
"autonomous modes just as they do would a GPS is available."
msgstr "以下是允许飞行器在没有 GPS 的情况下估计自身位置的可用选项。启用后，就像有 GPS 一样支持所有自主和半自主飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page.rst:34
#: 9fedbcfbf70346bfa96c4ec6ad0d8c68
msgid ""
"Most of the above systems (except Beacons) require that the ORIGIN be set "
"manually, except if a GPS is present. In order to do this the user must "
"either use the GCS to set Origin, as shown below using Mission Planner, or "
"use a lua script like this `one "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"set-origin.lua>`__"
msgstr ""
"上述大多数系统（信标除外）要求手动设置原点，除非有 GPS 存在。为此，用户须通过地面站设置原点（如下图所示，使用 Mission "
"Planner），或使用 `此 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/ahrs-"
"set-origin.lua>`__ lua 脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page.rst:39
#: 2d0290e055f14ed1a4416c3de3dcd283
msgid ""
"The low cost IMUs (accelerometers, gyros, compass) used in most autopilots "
"drift too quickly to allow position estimation without an external velocity "
"or position source.  In other words, low-cost IMUs on their own are not "
"sufficient for estimating position."
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控使用的低成本 IMU（加速度计、陀螺仪、罗盘）漂移过快，无法在没有外部速度或位置来源的情况下进行位置估算。换句话说，低成本 IMU "
"本身不足以用于位置估算。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page.rst:42
#: a802f68bfeab42be970939da3b91fe03
msgid ""
"A board with more than 1MB of flash is required to run non-GPS navigation, "
"except for Vicon as 1MB boards still support the GPS_INPUT message, although"
" they don't support the GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE so they have to be "
"run using the GPS_INPUT message. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations <common-"
"limited_firmware>` for details."
msgstr ""
"运行非 GPS 导航需要超过 1MB Flash 的飞控板，Vicon 除外（1MB 板仍支持 GPS_INPUT 消息，但不支持 "
"GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE，因此必须使用 GPS_INPUT 消息运行）。详情参见 :ref:`固件限制 "
"<common-limited_firmware>`。"

